1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,464
Review your LaTeX beside the PDF, with suggestions you control.

2
00:00:06,083 --> 00:00:11,884
Quick alternative adds a saved choice. Pick the wording you prefer, or edit it yourself.

3
00:00:13,183 --> 00:00:17,362
Preview a suggestion in the PDF before changing the draft.

4
00:00:18,383 --> 00:00:23,117
Accept several corrections with Shift A, without compiling after each one.

5
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:26,815
Compile once to refresh the PDF.

6
00:00:27,683 --> 00:00:30,373
Ask Side Chat about the paper or the editor.

7
00:00:33,083 --> 00:00:36,795
Turn useful answers into suggestions for your own review.

8
00:00:38,117 --> 00:00:43,828
Changes PDF shows revisions in the typeset paper: deletions struck out, additions

9
00:00:43,828 --> 00:00:47,160
underlined. Step through the changes in context.

10
00:00:48,217 --> 00:00:53,694
Save the draft and close the project. Your paper, your decisions. Modern Editor.
